#: {{ux|en|If you want to lose your virginity, you should try to '''solicit''' some fine looking women.}}
# {{lb|en|transitive}} To [[offer]] to [[perform]] [[sexual]] [[activity]], especially when for a [[payment]].
#: {{ux|en|My girlfriend tried to '''solicit''' me for sex, but I was tired.}}
