# {{lb|en|transitive|logic}} To [[infer]] by [[induction]].
#: {{ant|en|deduce}}
# {{lb|en|transitive|obsolete}} To [[lead in]], [[bring in]], [[introduce]].
# {{lb|en|transitive|obsolete}} To [[draw on]], [[place upon]]. {{rfex|en}}

